  <nav class="catrow"><span class="catgrp"><b>News</b><a href="/category/national">national</a><a href="/category/world">world</a><a href="/category/defence">defence</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Money</b><a href="/category/business">business</a><a href="/category/finance">finance</a><a href="/category/education">education</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Sports</b><a href="/category/sports">sports</a><a href="/category/cricket">cricket</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Culture</b><a href="/category/entertainment">entertainment</a><a href="/category/positive">positive</a><a href="/category/funny">funny</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Life</b><a href="/category/science">science</a><a href="/category/environment">environment</a><a href="/category/space">space</a><a href="/category/health">health</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Tech</b><a href="/category/tech">tech</a><a href="/category/ai">ai</a></span></nav></div><div class="gtr"><span>Read in your language:</span><div id="google_translate_element"></div></div><div class="wrap"><main id="content"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">← Front page</a> · <a href="/archive">Archive</a> · <a href="/category/entertainment">entertainment</a></p>
     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · TOI Entertainment · 2026-10-03 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Bollywood Celebrities Commend Captain Smit Machchhar's Heroism</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Film industry stars have publicly lauded Captain Smit Machchhar for his remarkable courage during a mid-air crisis. While piloting a flight from Dubai to Tel Aviv, Machchhar was attacked by his co-pilot and suffered multiple stab wounds.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-03/bollywood-celebrities-commend-captain-smit-machchhars-herois.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Despite his injuries, the captain successfully unlocked the cockpit door, enabling crew and passengers to intervene and neutralize the attacker. Following the safe resolution of the flight, numerous celebrities utilized social media platforms to honor his heroic actions in saving the 174 people on board.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article accurately summarizes the provided source material and maintains a professional tone.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/hindi/bollywood/news/r-madhavan-vijay-deverakonda-ravi-kishan-and-paresh-rawal-hail-pilot-captain-smit-machchhar-for-saving-174-people-on-a-flydubai-flight/articleshow/134638508.cms" rel="noopener">TOI Entertainment</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
