     <article class="story single" data-beat="education">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">EDUCATION</span> · Education (aggregate) · 2026-10-03 · editor 6/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>'Cockroach' Protesters Plan New Rally Demanding Election Chief's Ouster</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Education</span> <span>#Careers</span> <span>#Protest</span> <span>#India</span></div>
       <p>India’s 'Cockroach' youth protesters are planning to rally again, demanding the ouster of the nation's election chief, according to myRepublica. This renewed call for action follows previous demonstrations.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-03/cockroach-protesters-plan-new-rally-demanding-election-chief.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>According to ABC News, these 'Cockroach' protesters are demanding the resignation of India's election chief specifically over alleged voter list changes. The protests highlight concerns regarding the integrity of electoral processes.</p><p>What to watch: Further developments surrounding the planned rallies and any official responses to the demands.</p>
       
       <div class="provenance">
