      <ul><li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxPcXktUDJiZ05TZVJDY0N5dGJ3dFFOaFk1cXRodzZxclk1UHFUdldGVmkzVnFsZ1ZabWF1cG1VSXgtYlEtenV5Slc0WXlVd0R5ckFMS0U4LW5DdnRLWXRTSDBWckg0RktMeWdDX0dCN2dHU2VwSWVPQ05teFJ0VUFJSlpyX0RBaE90QlV3aVF6bk1mdnFUWEZ0UGxKcTNUSDdVQlA2YS1rRWF0TzluNXZYOGUxUUNOakdrVUdEY2QwTzk3bWtNOWpPSkNR?oc=5&amp;hl=en-US&amp;gl=US&amp;ceid=US:en" rel="noopener">Education (aggregate)</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
