     <article class="story single" data-beat="cricket">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">CRICKET</span> · ESPN Cricinfo · 2026-10-03 · editor 6/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Dogra and Nasir Lead Jammu &amp; Kashmir to First-Innings Lead</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#cricket</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Jammu &amp; Kashmir secured a first-innings lead of 41 runs against Rest of India in their Irani Cup match in Srinagar. Despite being 166 for 8, the team recovered through a significant rearguard effort.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-03/dogra-and-nasir-lead-jammu-kashmir-to-first-innings-lead.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Lone Nasir contributed 64 runs off 58 balls while batting at No. 10 to bolster the total. This performance helped J&amp;K surpass Rest of India’s first-innings score of 237. The match continues with Rest of India trailing by 17 runs at the end of the second day.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is thin and fails to mention the key partner in the rearguard effort (Sunil Kumar) who was highlighted in the source headlines.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.cricinfo.com/ci/content/story/1556925.html?ex_cid=OTC-RSS" rel="noopener">ESPN Cricinfo</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/jammu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Jammu</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
