     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · TOI Entertainment · 2026-10-03 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge conf" title="Reported by TOI Entertainment, Bollywood Hungama">confirmed by 2 sources</span></div>
       <h1>'Hanuman Ansh' Set for Worldwide Telugu Release on October 9</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Hanuman Ansh</span> <span>#Telugu Release</span> <span>#Bollywood</span> <span>#Box Office</span></div>
       <p>The small-budget film 'Hanuman Ansh,' which emerged as a surprise box office success, is now slated for a worldwide Telugu release on October 9, 2026. The film, which had a slow start but gained significant momentum, has already grossed over Rs 400 crore globally, making a strong impact among Hindi-speaking audiences. Hombale Films, known for blockbusters like 'Kantara' and the 'KGF' franchises, and 'Salaar,' officially announced the Telugu release, with the film being presented by Swambhu Media Network, according to Bollywood Hungama.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-03/hanuman-ansh-set-for-worldwide-telugu-release-on-october-9.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The production house expressed its delight on Instagram, stating, &quot;We are delighted to bring the much loved #HanumanAnsh in TELUGU, for audiences to witness its divine brilliance on the big screen across the world.&quot; The announcement follows the film's successful run in other markets, where it garnered attention for its portrayal of faith and spiritual awakening.</p><p>Written and directed by Vishal Chaturvedi, 'Hanuman Ansh' delves into the life and spiritual legacy of Neem Karoli Baba. Shobhinav Satyaa and Chandan Anand play the lead roles, supported by Nikhil Dubey, Udaysinh Rajput, and Purnima Tiwari. The film's spiritual narrative has resonated with audiences, contributing to its strong performance despite its modest budget.</p><p>According to trade tracker Sacnilk, 'Hanuman Ansh' collected Rs 2.90 crore net in India on Day 56 across 4,345 shows. Its total India gross collection reached Rs 374.86 crore, with a net collection of Rs 317.38 crore. On the same day, it earned Rs 10 lakh overseas, bringing its total overseas gross to Rs 39.20 crore and its worldwide gross collection to Rs 414.06 crore. The production house is also involved in several upcoming major projects, including Prabhas’ ‘Salaar: Part 2 – Shouryaanga Parvam,’ ‘Suriya 48,’ and a collaboration with Bollywood star Hrithik Roshan.</p><p>What to watch: How 'Hanuman Ansh' performs with Telugu-speaking audiences globally.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: A thorough and accurate report that effectively integrates all provided source details, including specific box office figures and cast information.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>How this was reported · 2 sources</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/telugu/movies/news/makers-of-kantara-kgf-salaar-to-bring-telugu-release-of-hanuman-ansh-worldwide-release-on-october-9/articleshow/134638084.cms" rel="noopener">TOI Entertainment</a></li><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/south-cinema/hombale-films-to-release-hanuman-ansh-in-telugu-on-october-9/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>Synthesised from 2 independent reports on the same event. Details are attributed to the outlet that carried them; nothing outside these sources is published.</p>
    </div>
       
