       <h1>Kieran Culkin Expresses Desire for Long-Term 'Family Guy' Role</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Actor Kieran Culkin recently voiced his enthusiasm for his guest role as the Devil on the animated series &quot;Family Guy.&quot; Culkin enjoyed the experience so much that he informed the production team he would like to continue playing the character for the foreseeable future.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-03/kieran-culkin-expresses-desire-for-long-term-family-guy-role.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Production staff noted that Culkin was highly engaged during the sessions and brought a fun, collaborative energy to the role. The actor explicitly insisted that if the show decides to revisit the Devil character in future episodes, he is eager to return to the part.</p>
