     <article class="story single" data-beat="defence">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">DEFENCE</span> · Defence (aggregate) · 2026-10-03 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Mahindra Group and Embraer Select Nagpur for C-390 Assembly</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Defence</span> <span>#Aerospace</span> <span>#India</span> <span>#Manufacturing</span></div>
       <p>Mahindra Group and Brazilian aerospace manufacturer Embraer have identified Nagpur as the location for the assembly of the C-390 aircraft. This strategic decision aligns with their focus on the Indian Air Force (IAF) medium transport aircraft deal.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-03/mahindra-group-and-embraer-select-nagpur-for-c-390-assembly.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The collaboration aims to position the C-390 for future opportunities within India's defence sector. The selection of Nagpur underscores the companies' intent to establish local manufacturing capabilities for this specific aircraft model.</p><p>What to watch: Further developments on the IAF medium transport aircraft procurement process.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Concise and accurate reporting of the provided source summary regarding the C-390 assembly plans.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://news.google.?oc=5" rel="noopener">Defence (aggregate)</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/nagpur/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Nagpur</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
