       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · TOI Entertainment · 2026-10-03 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Radhikka Madan Praises Ali Fazal Following Lust Stories 3 Success</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Ali Fazal and Radhikka Madan have earned critical acclaim for their performances in Shakun Batra's segment of Lust Stories 3, which was released on September 18. Madan lauded Fazal as a phenomenal and versatile actor, noting that he is creatively satisfying to work with.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-03/radhikka-madan-praises-ali-fazal-following-lust-stories-3-su.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Fazal’s portrayal of the vulnerable character Varun has gained significant traction online, earning him a &quot;pookie&quot; tag from fans. This performance stands in sharp contrast to his calmer role as Guddu in the upcoming Mirzapur: The Movie.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft captures all key details provided in the source summary, including the release date, character names, and actor praise.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
