      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/hindi/bollywood/news/radhikka-madan-calls-ali-fazal-phenomenal-and-full-of-bizarre-ideas-as-internet-crowns-him-the-new-pookie/articleshow/134638439.cms" rel="noopener">TOI Entertainment</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
