       <h1>Sara Gurpal Injured and Clashes with Contestants on 'Rise and Fall 2'</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Contestant Sara Gurpal sustained a forehead injury while competing in a high-intensity gunpowder collection task on the reality show 'Rise and Fall 2.' Despite the wound, which resulted from helmet friction, she continued to participate until the challenge concluded without seeking immediate medical aid.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-03/sara-gurpal-injured-and-clashes-with-contestants-on-rise-and.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Following the Workers' team loss, Gurpal engaged in a heated confrontation with Shehzad Poonawalla, labeling the verdict biased. She also expressed frustration toward the Penthouse contestants, accusing them of lacking empathy after they witnessed her team's efforts throughout the physically demanding competition.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief effectively captures the core incident and the contestant's reaction, maintaining the tone of the report.</p>
