     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-10-03 · editor 6/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>T-Series Releases Romantic Song 'Shayad' from Main Na Raha Mera</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>T-Series has released the romantic track 'Shayad' from the film 'Main Na Raha Mera,' featuring Adhyayan Suman and Divita Rai. The song is composed by Rahul Nair with lyrics by Dev Pandey and vocals by Rekha Bhardwaj, whose contribution adds an intimate, emotional layer to the composition.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-03/t-series-releases-romantic-song-shayad-from-main-na-raha-mer.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The film, written and directed by Amit Kasaria and produced by Dharmesh Sangani, explores unspoken feelings of uncertainty and longing. The music video is currently available on the T-Series YouTube channel, with the audio track accessible across major streaming platforms. Adhyayan Suman noted that Bhardwaj's vocals provide a unique soul to the project.</p>
       
       <div class="provenance">
